  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Below Lady Cold Ash, he and An Xun are the leading rank sevens of Soul Pacifying grotto-heaven. She brings both to Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch’s meeting so they can gain experience among other rank seven elites. She helps An Xun secretly in their contest for nurturing support.",
      "chapters": [
        1974
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lady_cold_ash",
        "char_an_xun",
        "loc_soul_pacifying_grotto_heaven",
        "char_ice_crystal_immortal_monarch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lady Cold Ash summons him to represent Soul Pacifying grotto-heaven, meet Granny Skeleton in Eastern Sea’s black heaven, and show sincerity to cooperate. He accepts bitterly, knowing the trip clears An Xun’s path. He carries immortal materials as a meeting gift, travels through the five regions with an immemorial soul beast hidden in his immortal aperture, and enters Shattered Bone grotto-heaven. Granny Skeleton agrees to cooperate and sends him on to persuade Old Immortal Hua Yu. Hua Yu refuses an alliance but accepts resource exchange. Hua Song then invites him to stay for the world poetry competition.",
      "chapters": [
        1975
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "eastern-sea-mission",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_granny_skeleton",
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "loc_skeleton_grotto_heaven",
        "char_old_immortal_hua_yu",
        "char_hua_song"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At a capital teahouse Hua Song calls him envoy, shows him talent qi above scholars, and serves top scholar tea created by Hua Yu in youth. An Chong praises the tea for a trace of human path ingenuity, then struggles when asked to critique poetry.",
      "chapters": [
        1976
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "eastern-sea-mission",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Qin Ding Ling says Granny Skeleton was persuaded by An Chong’s words and wanted to join the two heavens alliance before Heavenly Court ambushed her.",
      "chapters": [
        2005
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "two-heavens-persuasion",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_ding_ling",
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan’s army takes the ruined Soul Pacifying grotto-heaven after An Xun flees, the remaining Gu Immortals are led by An Chong. Their souls were not tampered by Spectral Soul, they had fought An Xun before he left, and they are injured. Fang Yuan takes them in.",
      "chapters": [
        2071
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "soul-pacifying-fall",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    }
  ],
